              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Early Endosomes Mature into Late Endosomes 795  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "ESCRT Protein Complexes Mediate the Formation of Intralumenal Vesicles in Multivesicular Bodies 796  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Summary 798  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "THE DEGRADATION AND RECYCLING OF MACROMOLECULES IN LYSOSOMES 798  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Lysosomes Are the Principal Sites of Intracellular Digestion 798  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Lysosomes Are Heterogeneous 799  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Plant and Fungal Vacuoles Are Remarkably Versatile Lysosomes 800  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Multiple Pathways Deliver Materials to Lysosomes 801  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Cells Can Acquire Nutrients from the Extracellular Fluid by Macropinocytosis 802  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Specialized Phagocytic Cells Can Ingest Large Particles 802  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Cargo Recognition by Cell-surface Receptors Initiates Phagocytosis 803  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Autophagy Degrades Unwanted Proteins and Organelles 804  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "The Rate of Nonselective Autophagy Is Regulated by Nutrient Availability 805  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "A Family of Cargo-specific Receptors Mediates Selective Autophagy 806  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Some Lysosomes and Multivesicular Bodies Undergo Exocytosis 807  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Summary 807  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Problems 808  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "References 810"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
